zenite.codice.arconte.1=Craft the §5Eclipse Seal§r (crying obsidian in the corners, stardust on the edges and an eye of ender in the middle) and use it somewhere open.
zenite.codice.arconte.2=§dPhase 1:§r it pulls you in and appears behind you. §dPhase 2:§r raises a Black Veil, calls Echoes and fires novas. §cPhase 3:§r it gathers the Total Eclipse — get out of the marked line!
zenite.codice.arconte.3=Defeat it to claim the §dHeart of the Firmament§r and free the Celestial Vault.
