zenite.codice.comandos.1=§f/zenite:menu§r — Technique Wheel.  §f/zenite:codice§r — this Codex.
zenite.codice.comandos.2=With cheats: §f/zenite:kit§r, §f/zenite:nivel <1-10>§r, §f/zenite:arconte§r and §f/zenite:limpar§r (removes leftover vaults).
zenite.codice.corpo=§7The notes of one who reached the highest point of the sky.
zenite.codice.inicio.1=§lWelcome, sorcerer.§r The Zenith is the highest point of the sky — and, from now on, the source of your power.
zenite.codice.inicio.2=§b1.§r Craft §fStardust§r: amethyst shard + glowstone dust + lapis lazuli (makes 2).
zenite.codice.inicio.3=§b2.§r Craft the §bZenith Astrolabe§r: 4 stardust in the corners, 2 diamonds top and bottom, 2 gold ingots on the sides and an eye of ender in the middle.
zenite.codice.inicio.4=§b3.§r §fUsing§r the Astrolabe casts the selected technique. §fSneak + use§r opens the Technique Wheel.
zenite.codice.inicio.5=Techniques spend §bEther§r, which regenerates on its own. The bar shows on screen while you hold the Astrolabe or a Sigil.
zenite.codice.inicio.6=In §ecreative mode§r every technique is already unlocked and Ether never runs out.
zenite.codice.maestria.1=Defeating creatures and casting techniques raises your §bmastery§r. There are 10 levels.
zenite.codice.maestria.2=Each level raises your max Ether by 10 and speeds up regeneration.
zenite.codice.maestria.3=§eLevel 2:§r Vital Reversal.  §eLevel 4:§r Event Horizon.
zenite.codice.maestria.4=The §5Celestial Vault§r only answers whoever holds the §dHeart of the Firmament§r.
zenite.codice.tecnicas.1=Tap a technique on the Wheel to select it. §6Sigils§r cast a technique straight from the hotbar.
zenite.codice.titulo=§l§eZenith Codex
zenite.codice.traje.1=Each Attire piece is made from the matching diamond piece surrounded by Stardust.
zenite.codice.traje.2=§fDiadem:§r night vision and a halo that spins above your head.
zenite.codice.traje.3=§fFull set:§r Ether regenerates 2× faster, Speed I and the Veil costs half the Ether.
