zenite.tec.abobada.desc=The supreme technique: raises a starry sky around you. Enemies inside freeze before the cosmos, while you grow stronger and your techniques cost no Ether.
zenite.tec.abobada.nome=Celestial Vault
zenite.tec.horizonte.desc=Fuses attraction and repulsion into a violet sphere that erases everything in its path. Takes 2 seconds of focus.
zenite.tec.horizonte.nome=Event Horizon
zenite.tec.nova.desc=Fires a crimson projectile that bursts into a shockwave, hurling everything away.
zenite.tec.nova.nome=Supernova
zenite.tec.passo.desc=Folds space and takes you instantly to where you aim. Aim at a creature to appear right behind it.
zenite.tec.passo.nome=Spatial Step
zenite.tec.poco.desc=Sends a cyan sphere to where you aim. It pulls in creatures, items and even blocks, crushing whatever reaches its core.
zenite.tec.poco.nome=Gravity Well
zenite.tec.reversao.desc=Reverses the flow of Ether inside your body: heals wounds, puts out fire and cleanses negative effects.
zenite.tec.reversao.nome=Vital Reversal
zenite.tec.veu.desc=A barrier where everything approaches you but never arrives. Projectiles freeze in mid-air and no blow can reach you. Toggles on and off; drains Ether while active.
zenite.tec.veu.nome=Asymptotic Veil
